   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a collection of activities for help in methods, such as internal governance and control, evaluations, Results Based Management and audits that are offered to partners. Call-off against Sida&apos;s framework agreement and the assignment was performed by Setterwalls Advokatbyr&#xe5; AB.</narrative>
